'''Davenburg''' is a [[Kul Tiras (kingdom)|Kul Tiran]] embassy located on the northern edges of [[Stormwind Harbor]] in [[Stormwind City]]. Established by [[Vice Admiral Renhoff]], the Kul Tirans have been sent by order of the Lord Admiral to open diplomatic ties with the [[Stormwind (kingdom)|kingdom of Stormwind]] once again.<ref>[[Vice Admiral Renhoff#Quotes]]</ref>

